# location-tracking-system

IMPORTANCE SCORE: 55/100

The location tracking system implements geolocation services with the following key components:

1. Provider Fallback Chain
- Primary location data sourced through browser geolocation API
- Secondary fallback to IP-based geolocation 
- Final fallback to cell tower triangulation for SMS-enabled devices

2. Location Accuracy Management
- Dynamic accuracy threshold calculations based on use case
- Confidence scoring incorporating multiple data points:
  - GPS accuracy radius
  - IP location confidence 
  - Cell tower density
- VPN/proxy detection to prevent location spoofing

3. Geographic Restrictions 
- County-boundary validation for check-in compliance
- Permitted radius calculations from registered addresses
- Exclusion zone enforcement

Relevant File Paths:
- app/geo.py - Core geolocation service implementation
- app/templates/admin_last_area.html - Admin location history view
- app/templates/checkin.html - User check-in interface

The system provides location validation services specifically tuned for legal compliance and check-in verification workflows.

